Ctype: character type checks (ctype_digit, ctype_alpha, ...) by the
current locale.

The module ctype of PHP 8.2 for php82 of azsupport/ports, which
installs side by side with the other versions of PHP:
lib/php/20220829/ctype.so, loaded by its ini in etc/php82/conf.d, its
headers in include/php82/php/ext/ctype.
